{"name": "Marblearium", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roll. Relax. Explore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying physics and lofi beats, a laid-back marble adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter that calm fascination of marble runs we had as kids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No pressure,\u00a0 just explore a gigantic track and collect unique marbles along the way. Sometimes turbulent, always relaxing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CalmRush and Hypnotic Rolling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes turbulent but always laid back and relaxing. Almost hypnotic.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/a9f77b8f46e55b070c4a3b79e503d2bd.poster.avif?t=1786033600\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/a9f77b8f46e55b070c4a3b79e503d2bd.webm?t=1786033600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/a9f77b8f46e55b070c4a3b79e503d2bd.mp4?t=1786033600\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Button Pleasure and Satisfying Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press bouncy buttons, activate physics based mechanisms and discover what they do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/ad6cab0deb75aace9391a4721cd97a50.poster.avif?t=1786033600\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/ad6cab0deb75aace9391a4721cd97a50.webm?t=1786033600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/ad6cab0deb75aace9391a4721cd97a50.mp4?t=1786033600\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Marbles with Meaningful Loss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Marbles are scattered across branching paths and hidden shortcuts in a looping world. Find them all and unlock new routes as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fall off the track, and your marble returns to where you discovered it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/1a98b2b6c105f17f0b57c0e1955d81ae.poster.avif?t=1786033600\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/1a98b2b6c105f17f0b57c0e1955d81ae.webm?t=1786033600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/1a98b2b6c105f17f0b57c0e1955d81ae.mp4?t=1786033600\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explorative and Tactile</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an ever-changing track designed to feel physical and touchable.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/120c6dc3c6a1afaf8a993c30b50730cc.poster.avif?t=1786033600\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/120c6dc3c6a1afaf8a993c30b50730cc.webm?t=1786033600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/extras/120c6dc3c6a1afaf8a993c30b50730cc.mp4?t=1786033600\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "An oddly satisfying Rollventure. Collect unique marbles to unlock nostalgic, interconnected tracks as the world grows increasingly strange. Guided by a mysterious voice and laid-back lo-fi beats. Sometimes turbulent, always relaxing.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841910/e090f57d3c872fa0403553a336b9a89b0a7b3b4d/header.jpg?t=1786033600", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D Platformer", "Relaxing", "Physics", "Exploration", "Atmospheric", "Collectathon"], "developers": "vibnav", "publishers": "vibnav", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3841910", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/koCOuD2AcQ4", "first_seen": 1785974400.0, "review_rank": 146}